# Twenty levels rather than GMS's ten, every ladder ending where GMS's does:
# 40 status resistance, 40% elemental, 250% DEF and +20 attack.
#
# The guard is a chance to cancel the whole hit rather than to shave a share
# off it, which is what dodge_chance is; the stun on it is dropped. Of what is
# left the attack and the guard are worth something: the two resistances have
# nothing to resist, and DEF is already past what it can cancel. All of it
# waits on the off hand, which for a White Knight can only be a rosary.
name: "Shield Mastery"
skill_order: 6
description:
  "Increases Elemental Resistance, Abnormal Status Resistance, DEF, and "
  "Attack Power when a secondary weapon is equipped, and gives you a chance "
  "to guard."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_WHITE_KNIGHT
max_level: 20
requires_secondary: true
base {
  status_resistance: 2
  elemental_resistance: 0.02
  def_pct: 1.17
  attack: 1
  dodge_chance: 0.02
}
per_level {
  status_resistance: 2
  elemental_resistance: 0.02
  def_pct: 0.07
  attack: 1
  dodge_chance: 0.02
}
